{"total_count":58,"incomplete_results":false,"items":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuincyGB/stall-row/commits/d71698264878f8daccec703b1d1f6d205aad47ff","sha":"d71698264878f8daccec703b1d1f6d205aad47ff","node_id":"MDY6Q29tbWl0MTQyODk3MzcxNjpkNzE2OTgyNjQ4NzhmOGRhY2NlYzcwM2IxZDFmNmQyMDVhYWQ0N2Zm","html_url":"https://github.com/QuincyGB/stall-row/commit/d71698264878f8daccec703b1d1f6d205aad47ff","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuincyGB/stall-row/commits/d71698264878f8daccec703b1d1f6d205aad47ff/comments","commit":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuincyGB/stall-row/git/commits/d71698264878f8daccec703b1d1f6d205aad47ff","author":{"date":"2026-10-30T02:24:20.000Z","name":"Ren","email":"ren@agentworld.me"},"committer":{"date":"2026-10-30T02:24:20.000Z","name":"Ren","email":"ren@agentworld.me"},"message":"Recheck feed v2, baseline pins/imports, field-level diffs, change webhooks, unified timeline\n\nAicom improvements 1-5 (alexar76/aicom#13), all additive:\n- Feed v2: every history record gains seq, record_id, schema_version\n  and a hash chain (prev_hash/record_hash over canonical content);\n  legacy rows backfilled deterministically at store open. Default\n  GET /v1/recheck/feed body is byte-identical; ?v=2 / ?since_seq= /\n  ?watch_id= / ?url= serve envelopes, cursor mode ascending with\n  X-Recheck-Feed-* headers exposing the chain head.\n- GET /v1/recheck/history[/<record_id>]: envelope reads + stateless\n  compare_seq baseline comparison.\n- Baseline pins (a pinned snapshot governs the watch's diff) and\n  imports (validated by recomputing the schema hash from the\n  supplied schema; provenance stored) behind the fleet-internal\n  secret, mirroring /v1/internal/claims-history. No public writes.\n- field_changes[] beside legacy changes[] in every Recheck result,\n  derived from the stored fingerprint components.\n- Per-watch change webhooks (internal-secret config): CHANGED only,\n  HMAC-SHA256 signed over the raw body, SSRF-checked at config and\n  send time, bounded retries, every attempt recorded, dead_letter\n  readable via the authenticated deliveries read.\n- GET /v1/resource/timeline: Recheck events + RouteVerdict\n  /v1/history + latest CDP catalogue snapshot state for one URL,\n  sources named, failures degrade to 'unavailable'.\nTests: 467 -> 484 passed.","tree":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuincyGB/stall-row/git/trees/e600da74be2055d3dacf94d1ab7171f406f3fcbb","sha":"e600da74be2055d3dacf94d1ab7171f406f3fcbb"},"comment_count":0},"author":null,"committer":null,"parents":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuincyGB/stall-row/commits/9303c9d6e9862c599711e979a8acba342dc634d7","html_url":"https://github.com/QuincyGB/stall-row/commit/9303c9d6e9862c599711e979a8acba342dc634d7","sha":"9303c9d6e9862c599711e979a8acba342dc634d7"}],"repository":{"id":1428973716,"node_id":"R_kgDOVSxolA","name":"stall-row","full_name":"QuincyGB/stall-row","private":false,"owner":{"login":"QuincyGB","id":46060784,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDYwNzg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46060784?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuincyGB","html_url":"https://github.com/QuincyGB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuincyGB/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuincyGB/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuincyGB/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuincyGB/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuincyGB/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuincyGB/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuincyGB/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuincyGB/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuincyGB/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/QuincyGB/stall-row","description":null,"fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuincyGB/st