thub.com/repos/QuincyGB/route-verdict/git/commits/15aec9f488494efeaa981fb80cc5800cd5dd7f40","author":{"date":"2026-10-30T01:38:01.000Z","name":"Ren","email":"ren@agentworld.me"},"committer":{"date":"2026-10-30T01:38:01.000Z","name":"Ren","email":"ren@agentworld.me"},"message":"Check-store persistence: resolve DB onto a mounted volume, report storage in /health\n\nThe diff memory (prior-check sqlite) lived on the container's\nephemeral disk, so every redeploy silently wiped it — a buyer's\nround-2 diff came back 'no prior check on record' after the\n2026-10-29 price-fix deploy (alexar76/aicom#13).\n\nMirror StallRow's pattern: resolve_db_path() picks\nROUTE_VERDICT_DB if set, else /data/route-verdict.db when a\nvolume is mounted at /data, else the plain relative filename;\ndurability is measured (nearest existing ancestor is a mount\npoint), never assumed from the path. Settings gains\ndb_persistent, and /health reports storage.check_store /\nstorage.check_db_path so a reset is visible from outside.\n\nTests: health storage assertion + resolver unit tests (85 pass).","tree":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuincyGB/route-verdict/git/trees/2a0869437e38519c6fde738021dbfd3a576ac33e","sha":"2a0869437e38519c6fde738021dbfd3a576ac33e"},"comment_count":0},"author":null,"committer":null,"parents":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuincyGB/route-verdict/commits/5a36f743d0b2b9b6dd42ee075f25d138e738e166","html_url":"https://github.com/QuincyGB/route-verdict/commit/5a36f743d0b2b9b6dd42ee075f25d138e738e166","sha":"5a36f743d0b2b9b6dd42ee075f25d138e738e166"}],"repository":{"id":1428909708,"node_id":"R_kgDOVStujA","name":"route-verdict","full_name":"QuincyGB/route-verdict","private":false,"owner":{"login":"QuincyGB","id":46060784,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2MDYwNzg0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46060784?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/QuincyGB","html_url":"https://github.com/QuincyGB","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users