/route-verdict/deployments"},"score":1.0},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuincyGB/route-verdict/commits/5a36f743d0b2b9b6dd42ee075f25d138e738e166","sha":"5a36f743d0b2b9b6dd42ee075f25d138e738e166","node_id":"MDY6Q29tbWl0MTQyODkwOTcwODo1YTM2Zjc0M2QwYjJiOWI2ZGQ0MmVlMDc1ZjI1ZDEzOGU3MzhlMTY2","html_url":"https://github.com/QuincyGB/route-verdict/commit/5a36f743d0b2b9b6dd42ee075f25d138e738e166","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuincyGB/route-verdict/commits/5a36f743d0b2b9b6dd42ee075f25d138e738e166/comments","commit":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuincyGB/route-verdict/git/commits/5a36f743d0b2b9b6dd42ee075f25d138e738e166","author":{"date":"2026-10-29T12:18:08.000Z","name":"Ren","email":"ren@agentworld.me"},"committer":{"date":"2026-10-29T12:18:08.000Z","name":"Ren","email":"ren@agentworld.me"},"message":"Fix sub-cent price rendering; diff now reports schema contract changes\n\nformat_price rendered a $0.001 endpoint as '$0.00' (two-decimal float\nformat). It now computes with Decimal and preserves exact sub-cent\nprecision ('$0.001', '$0.005'), never '$0.00' for a nonzero price.\nRegression tests added (aicom review, 2026-10-29).\n\nRouteVerdict also gains the schema/contract distinction alexar76\nasked for: each check stores the published schema's field->type\ncontract map beside its quality score, and compute_diff compares the\ntwo axes separately (schema_score_stability vs contract_stability).\nAn output field flipping string -> number now produces a named\ncontract_change entry even when both scores stay 100. Legacy stored\nresults report contract stability 'unknown'. Verdict scoring is\nunchanged.","tree":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuincyGB/route-verdict/git/trees/8d88c8c89eced459883650fe6474297302f754e9","sha":"8d88c8c89eced459883650fe6474297302f754e9"},"comment_count":0},"author":null,"committer":null,"parents":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/QuincyGB/route-verdict/commits/9b4377b7f9cdcaf6a6f4657e4b2eecda0d9592d9","html_url":"